    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO PEACE FOR THE WICKED\u2026 OR THE SQUIRRELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the ridiculous crusade of <strong>PooPig</strong>, the bravest (and most gassy) pig in this place!<br>Face off against the ruthless army of <strong>General Otto Von Squirro</strong>, rain down chaos with your shots, and <strong>steal as many acorns as you can</strong> in this <strong>colorful, over-the-top Bullet Hell packed with cartoon madness and visual gags</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DODGE. SHOOT. STEAL ACORNS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an avalanche of projectiles, bizarre enemies, and ever-evolving mechanics.<br>Each level in <i>PooPig</i> throws something new at you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items while dodging deadly bullets,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump through perilous platforming sections,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And clash in <strong>epic boss battles against outrageous, over-the-top characters</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through comic book-style panels, blending absurd humor with chaotic visual storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAND-DRAWN MADNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move, enemy, and explosion is brought to life through <strong>traditional hand-drawn animation</strong>, crafted with love, a pencil, and a very twisted sense of humor.<br><i>PooPig</i> isn\u2019t just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a constantly shape-shifting visual trip that <strong>keeps you guessing with fresh gameplay, settings, and surprises in every level</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to take down the deadliest squirrel in the galaxy?<br><strong>PooPig</strong> is waiting\u2026 with its butt in the air and its hoof on the trigger.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO PEACE FOR THE WICKED\u2026 OR THE SQUIRRELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the ridiculous crusade of <strong>PooPig</strong>, the bravest (and most gassy) pig in this place!<br>Face off against the ruthless army of <strong>General Otto Von Squirro</strong>, rain down chaos with your shots, and <strong>steal as many acorns as you can</strong> in this <strong>colorful, over-the-top Bullet Hell packed with cartoon madness and visual gags</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DODGE. SHOOT. STEAL ACORNS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an avalanche of projectiles, bizarre enemies, and ever-evolving mechanics.<br>Each level in <i>PooPig</i> throws something new at you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items while dodging deadly bullets,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump through perilous platforming sections,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And clash in <strong>epic boss battles against outrageous, over-the-top characters</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through comic book-style panels, blending absurd humor with chaotic visual storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAND-DRAWN MADNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move, enemy, and explosion is brought to life through <strong>traditional hand-drawn animation</strong>, crafted with love, a pencil, and a very twisted sense of humor.<br><i>PooPig</i> isn\u2019t just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a constantly shape-shifting visual trip that <strong>keeps you guessing with fresh gameplay, settings, and surprises in every level</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to take down the deadliest squirrel in the galaxy?<br><strong>PooPig</strong> is waiting\u2026 with its butt in the air and its hoof on the trigger.</p>",
